1:# LibreLift - Design Document
11:## Revision history
24:## 1. Context and scope
33:## 2. Goals and non-goals
47:## 3. System-context diagram
49:There will only be one type of user interacting with this system. They will create workout templates and record workout sessions. The CDN/API that provides a catalog of exercises will interact with the system by providing the exercise catalog via HTTP. Lastly, Supabase will interact with the system by providing the authentication service, database and data access layer, and serverless backend to handle HTTP requests for auth and data access.
53:## 4. Architecture and components
61:| Authentication | Accepts authentication requests via HTTP, uses Supabase auth to accept or reject | HTTPHandler                         | function calls, HTTP                  |
